 "words_heard": 177,
 "words": 178,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Against you, you alone, have I sinned",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And my sin is always there before me again",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I have done what is evil in your sight, I know",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Have mercy on me, O God, and do not let me go",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Create in me a clean heart, O God",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And renew a steadfast spirit within me",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not cast me from your presence",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And do not take your holy Spirit from me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Cleanse me with His Son, and I will be clean",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Wash me, and I will be whiter than snow",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The bones that you have broken, let them sing",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let me hear the joy and gladness that you bring",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Create in me a clean heart, O God",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And renew a steadfast spirit within me",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not cast me from your presence",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And do not take your holy Spirit from me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Restore to me the joy of your salvation",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And sustain me with a willing spirit",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A broken and crushed heart, O God, you will not despair",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Christ, created me, a clean heart, O God",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Created me, a clean heart",
